    "id":9,"name":"coding-prompts","output_tokens":128,"concurrency":8,"requests":32,"warmup":8,
    "text_prompts":[
      "请补全这个 Rust 函数。输入是时间顺序已经打乱的半开区间列表，把相交或相邻的区间合并，输出按起点升序排列。空区间跳过。避免为每次合并都重新分配内存。先写函数，再写一个覆盖相邻边界的测试。\n\nfn merge_intervals(mut intervals: Vec<(u64, u64)>) -> Vec<(u64, u64)> {\n",
      "Review this Python iterator used to group sorted log records by request ID. The final group is missing, and empty inputs yield a group with no records. Give a corrected implementation which preserves streaming behavior and include two regression tests.\n\ndef groups(records):\n    current = None\n    batch = []\n    for row in records:\n        if row.request_id != current:\n            yield current, batch\n            batch = []\n            current = row.request_id\n        batch.append(row)\n\nCorrected code:\n",
      "给定表 readings(sensor_id, measured_at, value)，每个传感器每分钟最多一条记录。用 PostgreSQL 返回过去 24 小时每个传感器的最大值及其首次出现时间。可能有多个传感器具有相同最大值。请给出查询、建议索引，并说明如何用 EXPLAIN ANALYZE 判断索引是否生效。\n\nSQL:\n",
      "In this Go service a producer sends work over jobs and closes it when finished. Callers cancel with ctx.Done(). Rewrite the worker loop so that it exits on cancellation or channel close and never processes a zero-value job after close. Keep only one worker goroutine.\n\nfunc worker(ctx context.Context, jobs <-chan Job) {\n    for {\n        select {\n        case job := <-jobs:\n            process(job)\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nRevised implementation:\n"
    ]
  },
